WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:12.630 --> 00:00:14.980
- [Graham] So I'm here
at Dig This Las Vegas.

00:00:14.980 --> 00:00:18.150
It's a construction equipment playground

00:00:18.150 --> 00:00:20.100
where you can live out
your childhood dreams

00:00:20.100 --> 00:00:22.690
of being able to operate heavy machinery

00:00:22.690 --> 00:00:25.530
like bulldozers and excavators.

00:00:25.530 --> 00:00:27.480
But first, gotta sign some waivers,

00:00:27.480 --> 00:00:30.493
gotta take a breathalyzer
test which is very important.

00:00:32.680 --> 00:00:34.690
And then you gotta put on this vest here

00:00:34.690 --> 00:00:36.143
for safety reasons.

00:00:38.940 --> 00:00:41.800
Before I head out to the playground,

00:00:41.800 --> 00:00:46.350
I have to take a 10 to 15
minute safety training course

00:00:46.350 --> 00:00:48.800
to make sure I'm safe out there.

00:00:48.800 --> 00:00:50.800
That's it, that's the safety course.

00:00:50.800 --> 00:00:51.700
I guess I'm ready.

00:01:12.790 --> 00:01:13.850
- [Junior] My name's Junior Diaz.

00:01:13.850 --> 00:01:15.762
I am an instructor and I teach people

00:01:15.762 --> 00:01:17.990
how to have fun on heavy equipment

00:01:17.990 --> 00:01:20.713
that they have never been on
any equipment in their life.

00:01:26.320 --> 00:01:29.807
Okay, rotate that cab to
the left as hard as you can.

00:01:31.771 --> 00:01:34.495
Faster, faster, come on, commit.

00:01:34.495 --> 00:01:35.495
There it is.

00:01:37.077 --> 00:01:39.910
You gonna do that push up or what.

00:01:47.667 --> 00:01:48.890
Oh ya, get that first groove.

00:01:48.890 --> 00:01:49.790
Good job.

00:01:49.790 --> 00:01:51.610
Alright, let's bring 'em up.

00:01:51.610 --> 00:01:52.823
Bring it up out of the hole.

00:02:20.460 --> 00:02:21.293
Good job.

00:02:29.027 --> 00:02:29.860
How was that?

00:02:29.860 --> 00:02:31.110
- [Graham] That was awesome, man.

00:02:31.110 --> 00:02:32.700
Man, that is such a blast.

00:02:32.700 --> 00:02:34.970
I mean it's so cool to be in charge

00:02:34.970 --> 00:02:37.083
of such a big, powerful machine.

00:02:38.220 --> 00:02:39.861
- Did you get your mind
off life for a moment?

00:02:39.861 --> 00:02:40.694
- I did, you know.

00:02:40.694 --> 00:02:44.250
When I was moving that dirt
and stacking those tires

00:02:44.250 --> 00:02:47.120
it was just a way for
me to kind of zone out.

00:02:47.120 --> 00:02:48.750
Just focus on simple tasks.

00:02:48.750 --> 00:02:50.190
- [Junior] And that's what
we want you guys to do

00:02:50.190 --> 00:02:51.140
when you come out to Vegas,

00:02:51.140 --> 00:02:53.320
is have fun and tap into
your inner childhood

00:02:53.320 --> 00:02:54.153
and have fun.

00:02:54.153 --> 00:02:55.090
- Thank you so much, sir.

00:02:55.090 --> 00:02:56.440
That was great.

00:02:56.440 --> 00:02:57.940
- [Graham] What was the biggest challenge

00:02:57.940 --> 00:02:59.646
you think I had out there?

00:02:59.646 --> 00:03:02.140
- Biggest challenge for you, I would say

00:03:02.140 --> 00:03:03.823
is getting your right from left down.

